Package: frmtmb.sample
Title: NUTS Sampling and Posterior Methods for 'frmtmb'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Forrence", email = "alex.forrence@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9728-6337"))
Description: Samples the posterior of a model assembled by 'frmtmb',
    by handing its 'RTMB' objective to 'tmbstan' and so to Stan's NUTS
    sampler. Applies the 'brms' default priors, samples the qualifying
    random-effect blocks in their non-centered form, and returns draws
    under 'frmtmb' parameter names. Provides the posterior method
    surface those draws support: expectations and predictions,
    pointwise log-likelihood and approximate leave-one-out
    cross-validation, hypothesis tests, conditional effects, posterior
    predictive checks, and conversion to the 'posterior' and 'coda'
    draws formats.
